{"type":"step-attempt","step":"cross-boundary-invariants","sessionId":"9ec2ba1d-b565-44de-a616-182faa608070","outcome":{"verdict":"approved","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/archive-from-issue/cross-boundary-invariants-result-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":true,"findings":[],"evidence":{"checked":9,"skipped":0,"unverified":0},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/cli/archive-from-issue.ts","title":"Double-fetch TOCTOU window between resolveArchiveBranchFromIssue and runAttachVerification","rationale":"resolveArchiveBranchFromIssue fetches the branch (checkpointOid A) and does 4-field identity match including pullRequest.number. Then runAttachVerification fetches the same branch again (checkpointOid B). The resolved.checkpointOid from step 1 is discarded; setupWorkspace materializes from B. attachArchivePolicy only checks that pullRequest.number is present (not its specific value), so a force-pushed branch between the two fetches could pass policy with a different PR number. This is a pre-existing pattern mirrored from resume-from-issue.ts and acknowledged in design.md Risk #2 as intentional duplication. Practical risk is negligible: awaiting-archive branches do not advance, and verifyCheckpoint identity checks (repo/jobId/branch/slug) prevent binding to a wrong job.","line":117},{"severity":"low","file":"src/adapter/github/github-client.ts","title":"listIssueLinkedBranches includes closedByPullRequestsReferences.headRefName (pre-existing)","rationale":"The pre-existing listIssueLinkedBranches returns a union of linkedBranches and closedByPullRequestsReferences.headRefName. For a job that escalated and then completed to awaiting-archive, resume-from-issue could find the branch via the closing PR reference. However, attachResumePolicy (the default policy for resume-from-issue, test-pinned by TC-020) rejects awaiting-archive checkpoints with not-quiescent — no path to incorrect attach. This behavior predates the current PR and is not introduced by it.","line":737}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-21T00:48:46.732Z","endedAt":"2026-08-21T00:59:09.576Z"}
{"type":"step-attempt","step":"scale-tolerance","sessionId":"b7e6e089-d4d4-4c0b-9a78-bc336b8940cd","outcome":{"verdict":"approved","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/archive-from-issue/scale-tolerance-result-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":false,"findings":[{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/issue-target/archive.ts","title":"resolveCompletedJobId: 全コメント走査コストの ponytail 追跡コメント欠落","rationale":"resolveCompletedJobId は listIssueComments を呼び O(⌈C/100⌉) API リクエストで全コメントを取得する。issue コメントは単調増加するためスケール感度が高い。対称関数 resolveEscalationJobId (resume.ts:54-58) には上限と upgrade path を明示する // ponytail: コメントが存在するが、archive.ts の同等呼び出しにはなく、デット追跡に漏れがある。","line":53},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/adapter/github/github-client.ts","title":"listIssueClosingPullRequests: first:50 上限超過時の無声切り捨て","rationale":"GraphQL closedByPullRequestsReferences(first: 50) は 50 件でハードキャップされており、それ以上の closing PR は無声で切り捨てられる。archive の closing PR locator はここが唯一の探索源であり、50 件超時に confirmed 0 件となって false ARCHIVE_FROM_ISSUE_UNCONFIRMED が発生し得る。上限到達の runtime logWarn も ponytail コメントも欠落している。","line":817}],"evidence":{"checked":4,"skipped":0,"unverified":0},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/issue-target/archive.ts","title":"closing PR ごとの逐次 git fetch は既存パターンと一致・one-shot かつ上限付き","rationale":"resolveArchiveBranchFromIssue は closing PR ごとに git fetch + rev-parse + readStateJsonFromRef を逐次実行する O(M) 操作だが、M は first:50 でキャップ済み。既存 resolveResumeBranchFromIssue も同パターンで、operator が手動で 1 回実行する one-shot コマンドであるため実用上の問題はない。design.md Risk セクションに ponytail デットとして記録済み。","line":127},{"severity":"low","file":"src/adapter/github/github-client.ts","title":"listIssueComments は Link header 追跡による完全 pagination 実装済み","rationale":"F-1 の指摘はスケール上限の文書化不足であり、実装の正確性を問うものではない。全件取得の実装は正確。","line":868}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-21T00:48:46.732Z","endedAt":"2026-08-21T00:52:29.519Z"